<title>USA: U.S. cotton weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. cotton weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. upland cotton major sales activity in the week ended Sept 5 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in 1,000 running bales:</p>
<p> Net Sales:   1996/97	   1997/98</p>
<p>  Canada	18,200		Nil</p>
<p>  Japan	 13,800</p>
<p>  Colombia    13,200</p>
<p>  S. Korea    12,800</p>
<p>  Indonesia   10,800</p>
<p>Weekly exports of 43,100 running bales were off 36 percent from the previous week and 11 percent from the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Asia, Western Hemisphere, and Western Europe.</p>
</text>
